      "value": "<div class=\"contentLayout2\">\n<div class=\"columnLayout two-right-sidebar\" data-layout=\"two-right-sidebar\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<h2 id=\"CreateanewForm-PurposeandBenefits\">Purpose and Benefits</h2><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Form Builder provides an easy way to create a new form and add the controls which are required into it. This way is more convenient for an implementer to create a form than the standard way of using a JSON file.</span></p><p><br/></p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-note conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"8b9467e7-e78b-46cc-85ed-bc7e10321fb8\" data-macro-name=\"note\"><p class=\"title\">Forms Directory</p><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-warning confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p>All the forms are saved in <strong>/home/bahmni/clinical_forms/ </strong>directory. The directory is set as a global property <strong>'bahmni.forms.directory'. </strong>Implementers can change the directory by updating the global property.</p></div></div><h2 id=\"CreateanewForm-Steps\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Steps</span></h2><h3 id=\"CreateanewForm-1.GotoFormBuilder\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">1. Go to Form Builder</span></h3><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Home Dashboard → Implementer Interface → Form Builder</span></p><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-center\" width=\"700\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/115085179/image2017-3-1_14-7-37.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1488348458929&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=199\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/115085179/image2017-3-1_14-7-37.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1488348458929&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"115087201\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"image2017-3-1_14-7-37.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"115085179\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"14\" data-media-id=\"9d67233f-3873-4c74-827d-c2d7b7c0f831\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/115085179/image2017-3-1_14-7-37.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1488348458929&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1400&amp;height=398 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/115085179/image2017-3-1_14-7-37.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1488348458929&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=199 1x\"></span><br/></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><strong>Form builder dashboard</strong></span></p><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\" id=\"CreateanewForm-2.CreateaNewForm\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><strong>2. Create a New Form</strong></span></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Click on the</span> <em><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Create a Form </span></em><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">button and enter a name for the new form.</span></p><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><strong><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-center\" width=\"700\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/115085179/image2017-3-1_14-30-33.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1488349836325&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=275\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/115085179/image2017-3-1_14-30-33.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1488349836325&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"115087466\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"image2017-3-1_14-30-33.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"115085179\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"14\" data-media-id=\"ad847f7c-ae57-4eac-b91b-b8f05142683b\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/115085179/image2017-3-1_14-30-33.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1488349836325&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1400&amp;height=550 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/115085179/image2017-3-1_14-30-33.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1488349836325&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=275 1x\"></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><strong style=\"text-align: center;\">Create a form</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br/></p><h3 id=\"CreateanewForm-3.AddControlsandSavetheForm\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><strong>3. Add Controls and Save the Form</strong></span></h3><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><a href=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/115085295/Add+Controls\" rel=\"nofollow\">Add some controls</a> into the form. The new form will be given a version named &quot;v1&quot; automatically. </span>After the form is saved, the <span class=\"legacy-color-text-green3\"><em><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">publish </span></em><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">button</span> <span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">is enabled.</span></span></p><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-center\" width=\"700\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/115085179/image2017-3-1_18-30-45.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1488364246926&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=319\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/115085179/image2017-3-1_18-30-45.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1488364246926&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"115090560\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"image2017-3-1_18-30-45.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"115085179\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"14\" data-media-id=\"4944859c-87a6-4e81-ba34-7ff847a6de3c\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/115085179/image2017-3-1_18-30-45.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1488364246926&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1400&amp;height=638 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/115085179/image2017-3-1_18-30-45.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1488364246926&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=319 1x\"></span></p><h3 id=\"CreateanewForm-4.PublishtheForm\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">4. Publish the Form</span></h3><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-green3\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Click on the <em>publish</em> button, the form will be published into the Bahmni app which means it can be used by the doctor. Once a form is published, it can only be edited directly. To edit a form <em>after it is published</em>, please <a href=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/display/BAH/Edit+a+published+form\" rel=\"nofollow\">refer to these steps</a>.</span></span></span></p><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-green3\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-center\" width=\"700\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/115085179/image2017-3-1_18-32-5.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1488364327979&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=350\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/115085179/image2017-3-1_18-32-5.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1488364327979&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"115090573\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"image2017-3-1_18-32-5.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"115085179\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"14\" data-media-id=\"4a3b1837-32d9-463d-b32c-ede3be3a6128\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/115085179/image2017-3-1_18-32-5.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1488364327979&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1400&amp;height=700 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/115085179/image2017-3-1_18-32-5.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1488364327979&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=350 1x\"></span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cell aside\" data-type=\"aside\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<div class=\"confluence-information-macro has-no-icon confluence-information-macro-tip conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"e6921b04-2089-48cb-990e-45bb5d87af22\" data-macro-name=\"tip\"><p class=\"title\">On this Page</p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p> </p><div class=\"toc-macro client-side-toc-macro  conf-macro output-block\" data-cssliststyle=\"none\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-headerelements=\"H1,H2,H3,H4,H5,H6,H7\" data-macro-id=\"0b744f92-0474-4511-ba50-ea4dc8343d16\" data-macro-name=\"toc\"> </div><p> </p></div></div><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"4084f2de-c0c2-4eeb-b02a-1184ccf78a4a\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;background-color: #1FA5A0;color: white;\"><b>Related Links</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/115085295/Add+Controls\" data-linked-resource-id=\"115085295\" data-linked-resource-version=\"16\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Add Controls</a></p><p><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/115085335/Edit+a+Published+Form\" data-linked-resource-id=\"115085335\" data-linked-resource-version=\"11\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Edit a Published Form</a></p><p><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/115085378/Rename+a+Form\" data-linked-resource-id=\"115085378\" data-linked-resource-version=\"6\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Rename a Form</a></p>\n</div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
